##################
## /media requests
##################

### GET all media items
GET {{apiUrl}}/media

### GET 3 latest media items
GET {{apiUrl}}/media?limit=3

### GET 3 latest media items (validation error)
GET {{apiUrl}}/media?limit=abc

### GET media item by id
GET {{apiUrl}}/media/2

### GET media item by id (validation error)
GET {{apiUrl}}/media/abc

### GET media item by id (Not found)
GET {{apiUrl}}/media/9999


### Add new media item with image (form-data) with token
POST {{apiUrl}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

bunny
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Picture of bunny
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="image.png"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./bunny.png
------Boundary--

### Add new media item (validation error: title too short)
POST {{apiUrl}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

a
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="image.png"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./bunny.png
------Boundary--


### Modify existing media item 
PUT {{apiUrl}}/media/9632
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "description": "updated desc",
  "title": "Uus title"
}

### Delete media item 
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/media/13
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

## /users requests

### Register new user
POST {{apiUrl}}/users
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "TestUser123",
  "password": "saladsakal",
  "email": "aa@x.xi"
}

### Register new user (validation error: invalid email & short password)
POST {{apiUrl}}/users
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "123",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

## Authentication routes

### Post login
# @name login
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "JaneSmith",
  "password": "to-be-hashed-pw2"
}

### Post login (validation error: missing password)
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "JaneSmith",
  "password": ""
}

### Get user info
GET {{apiUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}